## Security and Privacy Notice

This application is a learning project and is not suitable for real banking customer data without security, compliance, authentication, and privacy review.

It does not implement:

- login or authentication
- passwords or OTP
- bank account access
- financial transactions
- payment flows

## Final Notes

This project is intentionally simple, clean, and beginner-friendly. It is designed to be easy to understand and extend while teaching the basics of full-stack application design.

The goal is to learn local application architecture first and then build DevOps skills later in a structured way.

